BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Honorfest
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T230000
DTSTAMP:20261007T115224Z
UID:72c688b9-c3d1-414c-81c3-66c91d9e551c@honor-brewing-loudoun
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d
 -b748-5bdce62d911d/02be17aa-e085-44f9-bc53-3583d6642966/Live-Music-FB-Even
 t-Cover-2026-08-07T151441-140.png
DESCRIPTION:Raise a Stein at HONORFEST!\n\nGet ready for an unforgettable 
 day of Oktoberfest fun at Honor Brewing - Loudoun! Break out your lederhos
 en\, gather your friends\, and celebrate with great beer\, live music\, an
 d classic Oktoberfest traditions.\n\nWhat's happening:\n\n• HonorFest Ok
 toberfest Lager\n• $5 Honorfest\, Oktoberfest Lager\, pints ALL DAY\n•
  $10 Honorfest 4-pack specials\n• Traditional accordion music from 1–3
  PM\n• Live music by Bad Press Band from 6–9 PM\n• Stein Holding Con
 test from 12–6 PM (think you've got what it takes?)\, compete for braggi
 ng rights AND prizes\n\nPLUS purchase one our exclusive 2026 Honor Brewing
  steins and get your first beer fill on us!\n\nWhether you're competing fo
 r stein-holding bragging rights\, enjoying authentic Oktoberfest music\, o
 r simply relaxing with a cold pint\, there's something for everyone.\n\nMa
 rk your calendar for Saturday\, September 26 and join us for one of our fa
 vorite celebrations of the year. Prost!\n\nEvent listing: https://honorbre
 wing.com/honor-brewing-loudoun
LOCATION:Honor Brewing - Loudoun\, 42604 Trade West Dr\, Sterling\, VA 201
 66
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://honorbrewing.com/honor-brewing-loudoun
END:VEVENT
